&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Day -2 Hands on session using Factory Talk View Studio SCADA</strong>.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">The hands-on session included familiarization on SCADA software familiarization followed by working on the following modules using the kit.</p>

<ul style="text-align: justify;">
 	<li>Creating new server and Tag database</li>
 	<li>Creating graphics like Visibility, Color, Fill, Horizontal position, Vertical position Height, Width, Rotation</li>
 	<li>Creating Alarms and Trends</li>
 	<li>Interfacing PLC with SCADA using Simulator software.</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Day 3 Morning Session &amp; Afternoon Session. </strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">The third day of the workshop included Hands on experience on Demo model. Batch of 5 students was formed and each batch was exposed to work on Demo model brought by the resource person. When one batch of students were working on Demo model other batches were practicing example programs.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Valedictory Session</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong>Valedictory function of Three-Day Workshop on Automation using PLC &amp; SCADA was held on December 17<sup>h</sup> 2022 at Seminar Hall, Department of Mechanical Engineering, ATMECE which was presided over by the Resource person Mr. Shashikiran M, Managing Director, Vidyut Automation, Mysuru. Dr.Srinivasa K, HoD, Dept of ME, extended a warm</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">welcome to the Chief Guest as well as all participants of the course, Coordinators of the program, faculty members of the department. Dr.Srinivasa K presented a gist of proceedings of the Three-Day Workshop and mentioned that it is high time for the students to acquire knowledge on interdisciplinary courses and develop competence that will lead to career advancement. The participants were invited to give feedback on the Three-Day Workshop held on Automation using PLC &amp; SCADA. Dr. Chethan S, Convenor of the workshop concluded the program by rendering the vote of thanks.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><img class="wp-image-9837 aligncenter" src="https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/meee77-300x139.jpg" alt="" width="319" height="148"></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><img class="alignleft wp-image-9838 size-medium" src="https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/meee555-300x143.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="143"><img class="wp-image-9839 size-medium alignleft" src="https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/meeee66-300x138.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="138"></p>
&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

