<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Distribution of Certificates to Participants</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Impact of the Workshop</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">At the end of the workshop, students got the awareness about Automation &amp; latest technologies being used to achieve Industrial Automation. The idea of organizing this workshop is to inculcate the fundamentals of automation in the students and provide them with a platform to work.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">SCADA is used for the constructive working not for the destructive work using a SCADA system for their controls ensures a common framework not only for the development of the specific applications but also for operating the detectors. Operators experience the same "look and feel" whatever part of the experiment they control. However, this aspect also depends to a significant extent on proper engineering.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">The workshop organized enhance the knowledge of students in the interdisciplinary streams and lead a pavement to identify career opportunity in the field industrial automation. The event addresses the Program outcomes namely Modern Tool Usage (PO5), Engineer and Society(PO6), Team Work (PO9) and Communication(P10) and enhance the knowledge of industrial automation .</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
