<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Innovations in Manufacturing stream</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Department of Mechanical Engineering has organised a Technical Talk on Innovations in Manufacturing stream for 2<sup>nd</sup> year students on 24-06-2022 in the seminar hall and was inaugurated by Dr. Basavaraj L, Principal, ATMECE, Dr. Srinivasa K, HoD, Dept. of Mechanical Engineering, ATMECE and resource person Mr. H M Radha Krishna, Deputy Manager &amp; Head COE, GT&amp;TC, Mysuru.</p>
