<p style="text-align: justify;">Resource person was discussing on different innovation technology</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">It was discussed in the Session about the importance of manufacturing, Manufacturing is a rapidly evolving industry with a broad spectrum of sectors depending on manufacturing, modern facilities are often quick to adopt new technology that improves on their existing processes. The rise of automation, artificial intelligence (AI) and data have created a wave of digital transformation. As manufacturing grows and becomes increasingly competitive, capitalizing on Industry 4.0 innovations can determine whether a company will succeed. Cobots, IoT Sensors, Additive Manufacturing, 5G Connectivity, Machine Vision Error Detection are the different innovation technology evolved in current scenario. Also, resource person discussed on what are the opportunities will be given in GT&amp;TC regarding manufacturing stream.</p>
