<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="color: #000000;"><u>Visit to Technology Demonstration Expo at BEML</u></span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="color: #000000;"><u>Blood Donation, Eye and Dental Checkup Camp at ATMECE, Mysuru</u></span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;">As a part of NSS activity, the staff and students of ATMECE, Mysuru had organized a voluntary Blood donation camp, Eye Checkup and Dental checkup for the Staff and students of ATMECE at their college premises on 11<sup>th</sup> March 2020. The event was jointly organized by NSS unit of ATMECE and Indian Red cross Society, Karnataka branch.As many as 165 bottles of blood was donated on the occasion, staff and students participated enthusiastically for the noble cause.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;">More than 200 students have got their eyes checked by the Eye Specialists from Ismail Eye Care from Mysuru.&nbsp; Many students and staff members have also undergone Dental checkup by Megha Dental Clinic. The awareness about Dental care was also created by the specialists on the occasion.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;"><u><img class="size-full wp-image-5683 aligncenter" src="https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/me-blood-268x300-1-1.jpg" alt="" width="268" height="300">
</u></span></p>
