<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;"><img class="size-full wp-image-5685 aligncenter" src="https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/me-nss-300x138-1-1.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="138">
</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;"><img class="wp-image-5686 size-medium alignnone" src="https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/me-nss1-300x201.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="201"><img class="wp-image-5687 alignnone" src="https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/me-nss2-768x576-1-300x225.jpg" alt="" width="268" height="201"></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;">The objectives of the camp were to:</span></p>

<ul style="text-align: justify;">
 	<li><span style="color: #000000;">Cleaning of the streets of the village,</span></li>
 	<li><span style="color: #000000;">Plantation in the Temple premises,</span></li>
 	<li><span style="color: #000000;">Cleaning Government Primary and High School premises,</span></li>
 	<li><span style="color: #000000;">Health Checkup camp for the Villagers,</span></li>
 	<li><span style="color: #000000;">Drainage Cleaning,</span></li>
 	<li><span style="color: #000000;">Awareness about the ill effects of Blind believes,</span></li>
 	<li><span style="color: #000000;">Creating awareness about Fire and safety by Demonstrations in association with Fire Brigade, Pandavapura,</span></li>
