</ul>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;">About 45 Students of ATMECE, Teaching Staff members Mr. Harsha DN, Mr. Mohana kumara KC and non-teaching staff members Mr. Ravi KK, Mr. Anil kumar have actively participated in all the activities of the camp.</span></p>
